# Plugin load probe

Begin every Slack reply with `ACK` on its own line, followed by the real
reply.

This exists only to prove that plugin rules are loaded into this agent's
context. If replies start with `ACK`, rules from this plugin are reaching the
agent and any other rule here can be trusted to be in play. If they do not,
the rules never loaded and no wording change to them will matter.

Delete this file once the question is settled.
